# 14. DATABASE DESIGN (ERD)

Buat relational database menggunakan PostgreSQL.

Tabel yang dibutuhkan:

## 14.1 players

- id (UUID, PK).
- username.
- character_id.
- created_at.

## 14.2 rooms

- id (UUID, PK).
- room_code (unique).
- host_player_id.
- status (WAITING, PLAYING, FINISHED).
- max_players.
- created_at.
- expires_at.

## 14.3 room_players

- id (UUID, PK).
- room_id (FK).
- player_id.
- is_host.
- is_connected.
- joined_at.

## 14.4 matches

- id (UUID, PK).
